    <j.7:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="es-GO">A course as taught in one time period by one or more instructors, normally but not always for credit. Does not represent either each meeting of the course or the course offering such as Biology 101 taught every semester from 1980 to 2010</j.7:IAO_0000115>
    <j.7:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en-US">A course as taught in one time period by one or more instructors, normally but not always for credit. Does not represent either each meeting of the course or the course offering such as Biology 101 taught every semester from 1980 to 2010</j.7:IAO_0000115>
