  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.org/net/OCRe/study_design.owl#Single_group_study">
    <j.20:develop_comment>Simona: to be reviewed</j.20:develop_comment>
    <j.2:curator>Simona</j.2:curator>
    <j.7:IAO_0000115>A single group study is an interventional study that has only a single allocation group and no contemporaneuos comparison group.
A study in which an individual acts has his/her own comparison does not fall into this category, since an individual is not a group.</j.7:IAO_0000115>
