    <j.16:publicDescriptionAnnot xml:lang="en-US">CODEN – according to ASTM standard E250 – is a six character, alphanumeric bibliographic code, that provides concise, unique and unambiguous identification of the titles of serials and non-serial publications from all subject areas.</j.16:publicDescriptionAnnot>
